  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/4fb5f63dabe1cc9233.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"מסתבך מול היצע התפריטים בהזמנת סושי\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"589\" data-original-width=\"883\" height=\"266\" src=\"/assets/images/content/4fb5f63dabe1cc9233.gif\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">עודפי שליו ועודפי אפשרויות<span><br /></span></span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַד אֲשֶׁר יֵצֵא מֵאַפְּכֶם וְהָיָה לָכֶם לְזָרָא</span></blockquote><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַכֹּל בַּחַיִּים, זֶה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עִנְיָן שֶׁל סִדְרֵי עֲדִיפוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם לְהִשָּׁאֵר רָזֶה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹ לִסְבֹּל מֵעֹדֶף חֻמְצִיּוּת?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּמְעַט כָּל אֶחָד נוֹשֵׂא,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֹדֶף, אוֹ מַשֶּׁהוּ מְיֻתָּר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל אִישׁ כָּזֶה, מְנַסֶּה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהִפָּטֵר מִמֶּנּוּ לְאַלְתָּר.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֵשׁ שֶׁסּוֹבְלִים מֵעָדְפֵי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מוֹטִיבַצְיָה, אוֹ מוּדָעוּת עַצְמִית.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַאֲחֵרִים, עֹדֶף חֶלְקִיקֵי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָבָץ, בַּרְזֶל וְכַסְפִּית.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל חֲנוּיוֹת הַחַשְׁמַל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַכְרִיזוֹת&nbsp;עַל עוֹדְפֵי יְבוּא.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל מֵעָדְפֵי חַשְׁכָּ\"ל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁקֶל לֹא תִּרְאוּ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַ'מָעֳדָפִים' כְּבָר מִזְּמַן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יָצְאוּ מִתּוֹךְ הַדַּפְדְּפָן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְכָל חֲנוּיוֹת הַיְּבוּאָן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֲדִיפוּת לִמְשַׁלְּמִים בִּמְזֻמָּן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">'עָדִיף לְהִשְׁתַּמֵּשׁ לִפְנֵי',</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה מַבְטִיחַ סֵטֵרִילִיזַצְיָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֻמְחִים מַזְהִירִים מִפְּנֵי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֹדֶף מִשְׁפְּטִיזַצְיָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל לְסוֹדוֹת הַיְּקוּם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">טֶרֶם נִמְצָא מַעֲנֶה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַאִם בִּנְסִיעָה לְיׇּקוּם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עָדִיף לְהַפְעִיל מוֹנֶה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבִכְלָל, שַׁלְוָה אוֹ אַמְבִּיצְיָה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גַּז אוֹ אִינְדּוּקְצִיָּה?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִסְמֹךְ עַל אִינְטוּאִיצְיָה –</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹ לְהַפְעִיל אִינְטֵלִיגֶנְצִיָּה?</span></p>"
}
